	(text "Ports as on the PCB, not as Klipper names them:\nE = stepper_x (A), Y = stepper_y (B), X = stepper_z (Z),\nZ = manual_stepper axis_k (K, the key lock). Z and K on\nthe toolhead. The Z port is built for two motors in\nseries: one motor closes the loop across both headers."
